WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.086
Sustainable computing considers energy, material use, maintenance, reuse and responsible end-of-life handling.

00:00:06.086 --> 00:00:13.186
A device’s impact includes manufacturing and disposal as well as electricity while it runs.

00:00:13.186 --> 00:00:18.765
Extending useful life can matter, provided security and reliability remain appropriate.

00:00:19.765 --> 00:00:24.775
60 W × 5 h = 300 Wh = 0.3 kWh.

00:00:24.775 --> 00:00:30.696
This is operating energy for that period, not the device’s entire lifecycle impact.

00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:34.795
Multiply by the relevant electricity rate if estimating cost.

00:00:35.795 --> 00:00:38.380
Which value is a unit of energy?

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:41.335
A kilowatt-hour measures energy; a watt measures power.
